          <div class="weekly-story">
            <p class="weekly-kicker">ELDRAZI TITAN · BORDERLESS CONCEPT ART</p>
            <h3>Ulamog, the Defiler</h3>
            <p class="weekly-intro">An impossible presence at the edge of the frame. Vincent Proce’s concept-art Ulamog brings the Eldrazi’s alien scale to this week’s floating showcase.</p>
            <p><strong>Ulamog, the Defiler</strong> arrived in <strong>Modern Horizons 3</strong> on 14 June 2024. This is <strong>MH3 #383</strong>, the mythic rare borderless concept edition illustrated by <strong>Vincent Proce</strong>, with traditional foil selected.</p>
            <p>When you cast this ten-mana titan, a targeted opponent exiles the top half of their library, rounded up. Ulamog enters with +1/+1 counters based on the greatest mana value among cards in exile, then ties annihilator to those counters. Its ward asks for two permanents, reinforcing the sense that even interacting with it has a cost.</p>
            <p>The original main-set #15 uses Chase Stone’s artwork; #383 is an artistic alternative, not just a foil of that image. Its concept treatment makes the creature’s strange silhouette the collecting decision before the finish.</p>
            <div class="weekly-fact"><span class="weekly-fact-mark" aria-hidden="true">◇</span><div><small>MANASCOUT’S PRINTING</small>
              <p><strong>#383 traditional foil</strong> is distinct from serialized #383z in double rainbow foil and etched #476. Wizards confirms nonfoil and traditional foil versions of the borderless concept Eldrazi; this feature does not imply serialization, texture or surge foiling.</p>
              <p>The slow void lighting and simulated reflections are ManaScout presentation effects. They do not animate or photograph the physical card’s foil surface.</p>
            </div></div>
            <a class="weekly-link" id="card-week-link" href="https://scryfall.com/card/mh3/383/ulamog-the-defiler" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View this exact printing <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <p class="weekly-source">Artwork and current card data: Scryfall. <a href="https://mtg.wtf/card/mh3/383/Ulamog-the-Defiler">Exact edition catalogue</a> · <a href="https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/feature/collecting-modern-horizons-3">Wizards’ concept and foil treatment guide</a>. Reviewed 9 November 2026.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
